{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-10-31 07:00:00', 'title': 'ASURAGEN TO SHOWCASE INNOVATIVE DIAGNOSTIC LAB SOLUTIONS AT AMP 2022 CONFERENCE', 'text': 'COMPANY ALSO LAUNCHES NEW ARMORED DNA™ MOLECULAR CONTROLS FOR MONKEYPOX AND CLOSELY RELATED VIRUSES MINNEAPOLIS , OCT. 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ASURAGEN, A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, WILL PRESENT ITS DIAGNOSTIC LAB SOLUTIONS AT THE UPCOMING ANNUAL MEETING OF THE ASSOCIATION FOR MOLECULAR PATHOLOGY (AMP), TAKING PLACE NOVEMBER 1-5 IN PHOENIX, ARIZ. THE COMPANY ALSO ANNOUNCED THE COMMERCIAL AVAILABILITY OF NEW MOLECULAR CONTROLS FOR MONKEYPOX AND OTHER NON-VARIOLA ORTHOPOXVIRUS DNA VIRUSES.'}